   $tpl$NEXG

CONFIRM YOUR EMAIL

Your code: {{ code }}

Confirm my email:
{{ confirm_url }}

Hi{{#first_name}} {{ first_name }}{{/first_name}}, tap the button, or
type the code into the NEXG app, to confirm your email and finish
setting up your account. Both work once, for 10 minutes.

DIDN’T SIGN UP?
Someone may have typed your email by mistake. You can ignore this email;
nothing happens without the code.

--
Questions? Open Help in the app or write to info@nexgapp.com.
You’re getting this because this email was used to sign up for NEXG · NEXG, nexgapp.com
