$tpl$,
   $tpl$NEXG

PASSWORD
Choose a new password

Hi{{#first_name}} {{ first_name }}{{/first_name}}, we got a request to
reset the password for {{ email }}. Tap the button to choose a new one.

Choose a new password:
{{ reset_url }}

The link works once and runs out after 10 minutes. Then sign in to the
app with your new password.

DIDN’T ASK FOR THIS?
You can ignore this email; your password stays the same. NEXG will never
ask you for your password.

--
Questions? Open Help in the app or write to info@nexgapp.com.
You’re getting this because of your NEXG account · NEXG, nexgapp.com
