PASSWORD CHANGED
Your password was changed
{{ changed_at }}

Hi{{#first_name}} {{ first_name }}{{/first_name}}, the password for your
NEXG account was changed{{#device}} on {{ device }}{{/device}}. If this
was you, there’s nothing to do.

Wasn’t you? Secure your account now: choose a new password and sign out
of every phone.

Secure my account:
{{ security_url }}

--
Questions? Open Help in the app or write to info@nexgapp.com.
You’re getting this because of your NEXG account · NEXG, nexgapp.com
