WELCOME TO NEXG HOSTS
Let’s get you set up
{{ business_name }}

Hi{{#first_name}} {{ first_name }}{{/first_name}}, thanks for
registering with NEXG Hosts. Your first month of property management is
free.

- Set your password with the button below.
- Upload your ID and proof that you can let the property.
- List your units once NEXG has approved your documents.

Set your password:
{{ set_password_url }}

The link works once and runs out after 10 minutes. If it has, choose
“Forgot password” and enter {{ email }}.

--
Questions? Open Help in the app or write to info@nexgapp.com.
